For the weekend: OpenAI offers discounts up to 90 percent to poach Anthropic's biggest customers: Report on the discounts with figures for Rippling, Replit and DataCamp.

00:08:27.075 --> 00:08:35.379
Chinese AI model Kimi K3.1 Pro is closing in on Anthropic's Claude Opus 5.5: Benchmarks, prices and parameter count of the Chinese model.

00:08:35.379 --> 00:08:43.623
Updated Google privacy policy says your Gmail might be used for advertising: What changes in Google's policy and where to switch it off.

00:08:45.023 --> 00:08:45.773
The outlook.

