According to heise, Meta plans to update its terms for business accounts on October 30.

00:08:51.212 --> 00:08:55.338
Moonshot plans to release the Kimi K3.1 Pro weights by November 4.

00:08:55.338 --> 00:08:59.964
The EU Parliament is to find its position on the Data Omnibus in February.

